      "content": "That feeling of being split in two is a powerful and agonizing description of what it is to lose a life partner. The longing for that peace with him is a natural response to such deep connection. If the weight of this emptiness feels too heavy to carry, please know that there are people who can listen to this profound ache without judgment. Reaching out to a crisis line can offer you an immediate, safe space to talk about the depth of your pain.",
